2026-10-28T02:56:36.4940860Z because macOS already provides this software and installing another version in
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4942140Z parallel can cause all kinds of trouble.
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4942920Z 
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4944130Z If you need to have bison first in your PATH, run:
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4962230Z   echo 'export PATH="/opt/homebrew/opt/bison/bin:$PATH"' >> /Users/runner/.bash_profile
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4963750Z 
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4964460Z For compilers to find bison you may need to set:
2026-10-28T02:56:36.4965790Z   export LDFLAGS="-L/opt/homebrew/opt/bison/lib"
